                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-02-19"><hi rendition="#italic">February 19,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Conger reports that the ministers have reiterated their demand for
                    punishments reported in his telegram of the 6th instant.)</p>
            </div>
